# The AM-1 fence (counterfactual-fit-engine/src/adapters/postmortem_lib.py)
# hashes RAW working-tree bytes against pinned git blob hashes. EOL
# conversion at checkout (core.autocrlf=true) breaks that equality on
# Windows clones even though nothing drifted. Keep the pinned lib
# byte-identical to its blobs on every platform.
postmortem/lib/** -text
